# FF4 story regression: the new game from Baron castle, A tapped every 2.5 s for about three minutes.
#   FF3.exe --game=ff4 --drive=Docs/Drives/ff4-story.drive --log=general,file
# The log must show the opening scene, the return to the castle and no "Exception" lines (Testing.md C-36).
